agents/graph-wiki-agent/pyproject.toml: graph-wiki-agent | AWS Bedrock-powered wiki maintenance agent (MCP server + CLI) | py >=3.11
  deps: wiki-io, model-adapter, subagent-runtime, workspace-io, graph-io, bm25s==0.3.8, mcp>=1.27.1, langchain-aws>=1.4.7 ...
  scripts: graph-wiki-agent->graph_wiki_agent.cli:app, graph-wiki-mcp->graph_wiki_agent.mcp.server:main
packages/eval-harness/pyproject.toml: eval-harness | Deterministic eval checks, pricing, and sweep runner for graph-wiki-agent | py >=3.11
  deps: deepeval>=4.0.0, pytest-evals>=0.3.4, python-frontmatter>=1.1.0, aiobotocore>=2.13, graph-wiki-agent, subagent-runtime, model-adapter, graph-io ...
packages/graph-io/pyproject.toml: graph-io | Code-graph core for the graph-wiki ecosystem — SQLite store, manifest scanning, queries, and the cg CLI. | py >=3.11
  deps: source-parser, workspace-io, pyyaml>=6.0
  scripts: cg->graph_io.cli.main:main
packages/model-adapter/pyproject.toml: model-adapter | AWS Bedrock model loader for graph-wiki-agent | py >=3.11
  deps: langchain-aws>=1.4.6, boto3>=1.38
packages/source-parser/pyproject.toml: source-parser | Tree-sitter-backed Python package that turns source files into a span-bearing SourceTree, with a graph projection aligned to lattice-graph. | py >=3.11
  deps: tree-sitter>=0.23.0, tree-sitter-language-pack>=0.8.0,<=1.6.2
packages/subagent-runtime/pyproject.toml: subagent-runtime | Async fan-out primitive for graph-wiki-agent subagent dispatch | py >=3.11
  deps: langchain-aws>=1.4.6, langchain-core>=1.4.0, model-adapter
packages/wiki-io/pyproject.toml: wiki-io | Vault IO for graph-wiki-agent | py >=3.11
  deps: python-frontmatter>=1.1, boto3>=1.38, workspace-io
packages/workspace-io/pyproject.toml: workspace-io | Workspace bootstrap, manifest IO, and config resolution for the graph-wiki ecosystem. | py >=3.11
  deps: pyyaml>=6.0
